{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02632","headline":"游仙四首 一 · 王绩","name":"游仙四首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂出东陂路，过访北岩前。\n蔡经新学道，王烈旧成仙。\n驾鹤来无日，乘龙去几年。\n三山银作地，八洞玉爲天。\n金精飞欲尽，石髓溜应坚。\n自悲生世促，无暇待桑田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02632.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02632","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}